		(at 154.66 91.15 180)
		(descr "SparkFun Transceiver Breakout - RS-485 (SP3485), BOB-10124, soldered onto carrier as a module. 22.86 x 27.94 mm (0.9 x 1.1 in). Pads: 1x5 logic header (3-5V RX-I TX-O RTS GND), 1x3 RS-485 header and 3.5 mm screw terminal (G A B, shared pad numbers 6/7/8), 4x 3.302 mm NPTH mounting holes. RJ45 and its 1x4 pass-through header not broken out. Geometry from SparkFun Eagle .brd.")
